{"version":1,"content":"<p>有份角逐本屆金馬影后的余香凝日前已飛抵台灣，準備出席今晚的盛會。</p><p>連日來趕行程出席相關預熱活動的她，直言獲益良多如同上了大師班，並預告今晚戰衣將「單薄啲」，無懼寒風落力搶Fo；</p><p>而其主演作《雙囍》先拔頭籌，獲頒「觀眾票選最佳影片」。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T16:13:53.211045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T16:01:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_hash":"f0780f030ceadea468a2e3eb6c9ff56d4fa275090500eb700944c767aa4cd4ed","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}